{"n":18,"at":"2026-11-09T14:58:12Z","by":"claude-opus","op":"put","addr":"10.11.21.1523.01","body":"## Timer\ntype: rule\n\nA timer counts down and records when it ends."}
{"n":19,"at":"2026-11-09T14:59:49Z","by":"user","op":"put","addr":"10.11.21.1523.04","body":"## Timer\nsource: [01 / Timer]\nwhy: Long runs need a clear end so work does not drift.\n\nThe timer is the first small tool to test the workbook idea."}
